{"key":"50bc1c32321651f5","source_file":"Potts Rh - Ry.json","source_id":17073,"source_url":"concordance-rough-ppl-asper","term":"Rough","headwords":["Rough","Roughness","Roughly"],"latin":["Asper","Asperitas","Aspere"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Rough"],"latin":["Asper"]},{"english":["Roughness"],"latin":["Asperitas"]},{"english":["Roughly"],"latin":["Aspere"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","DP","DSS","DeVerbo","HH","SE"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"3527","subsection":"end"},"text":"The rough ways made smooth () = the falsities of ignorance turned into truths.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5246","subsection":"4"},"text":"Rough as to his face.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6516","subsection":"end"},"text":"A milder or harsher modification (of utterance).","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"HH","section":"368","subsection":null},"text":"The man has a rougher and less beautiful face.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DSS","section":"90","subsection":"2"},"text":"(In the Third Heaven) they do not express any consonant roughly, but softly... Roughness in letters is in use in the Spiritual Heaven... because truth admits of what is rough, but not good.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DP","section":"279","subsection":"8"},"text":"Through the trachea or wind-pipe.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"218","subsection":null},"text":"The intelligence of the men is grave, rough, hard...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"5620","subsection":null},"text":"The rough letters, which are uttered roughly. Enumerated.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"5622","subsection":null},"text":"See Hebrew language.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DeVerbo","section":"4","subsection":"2"},"text":"The rough letters... have no meaning (in the Third Heaven), except when they utter them with a soft sound, and this is why many rough letters are pointed within...","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"rough-50bc1c","url":"/meta/potts/rough-50bc1c/"}